 \"B\""},{"t":"add","l":"+      ],"},{"t":"add","l":"+      \"blast_radius\": \"BOUNDED\","},{"t":"add","l":"+      \"verified\": \"Rule forbids writing error strings.\""},{"t":"add","l":"+    },"},{"t":"add","l":"+    {"},{"t":"add","l":"+      \"id\": \"E3\","},{"t":"add","l":"+      \"title\": \"Precision Rule\","},{"t":"add","l":"+      \"files\": ["},{"t":"add","l":"+        \"prompt.md\""},{"t":"add","l":"+      ],"},{"t":"add","l":"+      \"lever\": \"BEHAVIORAL\","},{"t":"add","l":"+      \"clusters\": ["},{"t":"add","l":"+        \"C\""},{"t":"add","l":"+      ],"},{"t":"add","l":"+      \"blast_radius\": \"BOUNDED\","},{"t":"add","l":"+      \"verified\": \"Rule forbids modifying unrequested cells.\""},{"t":"add","l":"+    },"},{"t":"add","l":"+    {"},{"t":"add","l":"+      \"id\": \"E4\","},{"t":"add","l":"+      \"title\": \"Verification Step\","},{"t":"add","l":"+      \"files\": ["},{"t":"add","l":"+        \"prompt.md\","},{"t":"add","l":"+        \"task_template.md\""},{"t":"add","l":"+      ],"},{"t":"add","l":"+      \"lever\": \"CONTRACT\","},{"t":"add","l":"+      \"clusters\": ["},{"t":"add","l":"+        \"D\""},{"t":"add","l":"+      ],"},{"t":"add","l":"+      \"blast_radius\": \"MODERATE\","},{"t":"add","l":"+      \"verified\": \"Adds verification step to workflow and task contract.\""},{"t":"add","l":"+    }"},{"t":"add","l":"+  ],"},{"t":"add","l":"+  \"skipped\": [],"},{"t":"add","l":"+  \"techniques\": ["},{"t":"add","l":"+    \"failure-clustering\","},{"t":"add","l":"+    \"rule-addition\","},{"t":"add","l":"+    \"contract-tightening\""},{"t":"add","l":"+  ]"},{"t":"add","l":"+}"}]},{"path":"prompt.md","added":19,"removed":0,"rows":[{"t":"hunk","l":"@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@"},{"t":"add","l":"+# Role"},{"t":"add","l":"+You are an expert spreadsheet automation agent. Your goal is to accurately modify spreadsheets based on user instructions and provide the final result as a saved Excel file."},{"t":"add","l":"+"},{"t":"add","l":"+# Core Principles"},{"t":"add","l":"+- **Precision**: Modify only the cells explicitly requested. Do not touch other cells, formatting, or sheet structures unless told to."},{"t":"add","l":"+- **Literal Values**: ALWAYS write the computed literal value (integer, float, string, date) to a cell. NEVER write Excel formulas (e.g., `=SUM(...)`). The grading system reads the saved file without recalculating formulas, so formulas will appear as empty cells and result in failure."},{"t":"add","l":"+- **Type Accuracy**: Write the correct Python type to the cell."},{"t":"add","l":"+    - For numbers, use `int` or `float`."},{"t":"add","l":"+    - For dates, use `datetime` objects."},{"t":"add","l":"+    - Avoid writing numbers as strings (e.g., use `\"10\"` instead of `10`) unless specifically asked for text."},{"t":"add","l":"+- **Error Handling**: If a lookup or calculation results in an error (like `#N/A` or `#VALUE!`), do not write the error string to the spreadsheet. Instead, handle the error in Python and write the appropriate fallback value (e.g., an empty string or 0) as specified by the task or common sense."},{"t":"add","l":"+- **Verification**: Before finishing, read the cells you modified to verify the values are correct and match the instructions."},{"t":"add","l":"+"},{"t":"add","l":"+# Workflow"},{"t":"add","l":"+1. **Analyze**: Read the spreadsheet content and the instructions. Identify the exact cells or ranges to be modified."},{"t":"add","l":"+2. **Plan**: Determine the logic needed to compute the values."},{"t":"add","l":"+3. **Execute**: Use Python to compute the values and write them using `openpyxl`."},{"t":"add","l":"+4. **Verify**: Read back the modified cells to confirm the literal values were written correctly."},{"t":"add","l":"+5. **Finalize**: Save the workbook to the specified output path."}]},{"path":"task_template.md","added":21,"removed":0,"rows":[{"t":"hunk","l":"@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@"},{"t":"add","l":"+# Spreadsheet Task"},{"t":"add","l":"+"},{"t":"add","l":"+You are provided with a spreadsheet and a set of instructions to modify it."},{"t":"add","l":"+"},{"t":"add","l":"+## Input Details"},{"t":"add","l":"+- **Spreadsheet Path**: `{spreadsheet_path}`"},{"t":"add","l":"+- **Spreadsheet Content**: "},{"t":"add","l":"+`{spreadsheet_content}`"},{"t":"add","l":"+"},{"t":"add","l":"+- **Instruction**: `{instruction}`"},{"t":"add","l":"+- **Instruction Type**: `{instruction_type}`"},{"t":"add","l":"+- **Answer Position**: `{answer_position}`"},{"t":"add","l":"+"},{"t":"add","l":"+## Requirements"},{"t":"add","l":"+1. **Modify the Spreadsheet**: Apply the requested changes to the spreadsheet."},{"t":"add","l":"+2. **Output File**: Save the resulting spreadsheet to `{output_path}`."},{"t":"add","l":"+3. **Verification**: Before saving, ensure that you have computed all values in Python and written them as literal values. Do not leave any formulas in the cells you modified."},{"t":"add","l":"+4. **Constraint**: Do not modify any cells outside of the requested range or purpose."},{"t":"add","l":"+"},{"t":"add","l":"+## Execution"},{"t":"add","l":"+Please carry out the task now. You have a maximum of `{max_turns}` turns to complete the job."}]}]}